WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.053
This is a healthy back tooth from the lower jaw.

00:00:03.403 --> 00:00:06.475
Ridges join the bumps on top, like the walls of a box.

00:00:07.275 --> 00:00:11.329
A cracked tooth has a crack that starts on top and runs down toward the root.

00:00:11.679 --> 00:00:13.257
It does not always hurt.

00:00:14.057 --> 00:00:18.068
If the crack reaches the nerve inside, you may need root canal treatment.

00:00:18.868 --> 00:00:21.889
A large filling goes through both ridges. When you bite,

00:00:21.889 --> 00:00:23.561
the bumps can still bend apart.

00:00:24.361 --> 00:00:26.793
A crown wraps around them and holds them together.

00:00:27.143 --> 00:00:29.755
Studies found fewer nerve problems with a crown,

00:00:29.755 --> 00:00:31.495
but the numbers are not certain.
